{"data": [{"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-28T20:43:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115545020040183837"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/fawfulfan/stat…", "end": 282, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/fawfulfan/status/2115402217486168450", "start": 259, "url": "https://t.co/YO0uCLG6WC"}]}, "id": "2115545020040183837", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 591, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115402217486168450", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I thought this too.\n\nThen I learned that in fact the mom had hired a babysitter to check on the kids regularly and they were only actually home *alone* for a few hours, and had regular adult check-ins.\n\nIdeal situation?\n\nNo.\n\nCriminal arrest of the mom?\n\nNo. https://t.co/YO0uCLG6WC", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2115545020040183837"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-28T20:40:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115544170295148951"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/thehill/status…", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/thehill/status/2115514758313255211", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/iMU8WZcmJY"}]}, "id": "2115544170295148951", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 571, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115514758313255211", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "okay but what stood out to me in this story is:\n1) the stunt... worked? they actually got to the point where they could have voted? which seems like a huge problem?\n2) and the state now says that 0.6% of votes, enough to swing elections in some cases, come from the vouching https://t.co/iMU8WZcmJY", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2115544170295148951"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-28T20:35:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115542917297393687"], 